  message: "Mechanical backstop landed in PR #3839 (merged 2026-05-20 to sha 288cce184d). 36 new tests, 100% coverage on the new multi_value_field_axis module, ~40 fields retroactively annotated across Span / AnalysisRun / Symbol / Edge / ExternalRef / UsageContext / DataModel. Acceptance criteria status: A1 ✓ linter exists, runs <2s; A2 — DEFERRED (.githooks/pre-commit wire-up touches a governance file, needs human approval); A3 ✓ property test test_multi_value_field_axis.py with live-tree gate; A4 — DEFERRED (AGENTS.md essentialization update is governance); A5 ✓ ADR-0024 §Open Questions Q2 marked Resolved by WI-busij; A6 ✓ live tree passes. Five known axes wired: edge-type / symbol-kind / evidence-type (heavyweight registry-backed) plus language / pass-id (catalog-derived lightweight per ADR-0024 §4 'use judgment' carveout). Two design hatches considered and explicitly dropped: # axis: pending (duplicates todo_hard circuit breaker) and # axis: free-text without justification (would have been the can-kicker). Follow-on PR needed for A2+A4 governance wire-up."  # 953c
