  message: "A2 + A4 governance wire-up landed in PR #3840 (merged 2026-05-20 to sha da503f4087). Four files: new playbook .agent/agent_playbooks_protocols_sops_skills/multi-value-field-axis-declaration-playbook.md (practitioner walkthrough, ~370 lines covering four categories, decision procedure, how to add a new axis, two documented smuggling exceptions); AGENTS.md essentialization replacing the prose-only rule with the mechanical-gate version; PLAYBOOKS-list tuple in .agent/hooks/_shared/on_transcript_change.py for context-loading; .githooks/pre-commit entry that fires scripts/check-multi-value-field-axis-declaration when ir.py / datamodels.py is staged. All 6 acceptance criteria now complete: A1 (linter <2s) ✓, A2 (pre-commit wire-up) ✓, A3 (property test) ✓, A4 (AGENTS.md essentialization) ✓, A5 (ADR-0024 §3 Q2 marked Resolved) ✓, A6 (live tree passes) ✓. INV-rugok META now has all 6 children fully closed (4 satisfied + 2 done). 13730 tests pass, 100% coverage on changed source files. User pre-approved governance changes; auto-pr ran without --gov per direction."  # 7ca0
